{"4275900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Last State", "steam_appid": 4275900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Last State is a hardcore text-based survival simulation about planning, scarcity and consequences. You are alone in a post-collapse wilderness where every trip, fire, meal, injury and night can decide whether your run continues or ends.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is not a relaxing survival sandbox. It is a slow, punishing survival run for players who enjoy mastering complex systems.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect For Fans Of</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cataclysm: Dark Days Ahead</strong> for harsh survival decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEO Scavenger</strong> for desperate scavenging and risk</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UnReal World</strong> for wilderness survival depth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Project Zomboid</strong> for long-term planning and consequence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traditional roguelikes, text-heavy simulations and permadeath runs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4275900/extras/46dd5d52906a44aca9cef6b1bf9daec3.avif?t=1781194410\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4275900/extras_big/46dd5d52906a44aca9cef6b1bf9daec3.webp?t=1781194410 width=1560 height=424 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world didn't end with a bang. It ended with a whisper.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decades after the collapse of civilization, nature has reclaimed the earth. Cities lie buried beneath vines and roots. The old world is gone, swallowed by an endless, untamed wilderness. You are a child of this new world, born into the quiet, raised in the shadow of ruins.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4275900/extras/96ee1ac904fb1a0d6ea7bd1c0e26c594.avif?t=1781194410\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4275900/extras_big/96ee1ac904fb1a0d6ea7bd1c0e26c594.avif?t=1781194410 width=1560 height=514 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌲 Vast Procedural World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 unique biomes</strong>: dense forests, open plains, treacherous swamps, mountain peaks, lakeshores, rushing rivers, abandoned ruins and overgrown roads</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic location descriptions bring every area to life</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden caches, abandoned camps and points of interest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> 🔥 Deep Survival Mechanics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor <strong>hunger, thirst, warmth, fatigue, and hygiene</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build fires to stay warm and cook food</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct shelters and eventually permanent housing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weather the seasons from brutal winters to scorching summers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage injuries and illness with crafted medicine and bandages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4275900/extras/5f421baad5a85f69529275d4d5c6a8b6.avif?t=1781194410\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4275900/extras_big/5f421baad5a85f69529275d4d5c6a8b6.avif?t=1781194410 width=1560 height=510 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎯 Hunting &amp; Gathering</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track and hunt <strong>different animal species </strong>from rabbits to bears and wolves</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish in rivers and lakes with rods, traps and bait</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources from each biome: mushrooms, berries, herbs, minerals and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set snare traps and fish traps for passive food gathering</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌾 Farming &amp; Settlement Building</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish farm plots and grow <strong>15 different crops</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant fruit trees and berry bushes for long-term food security</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build permanent structures with planks, beams, walls and roofing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own refuge in the wilderness</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4275900/extras/c2c026764da2671d36f1ddd5a1d216ba.avif?t=1781194410\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4275900/extras_big/c2c026764da2671d36f1ddd5a1d216ba.avif?t=1781194410 width=1560 height=510 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🛠️ Extensive Crafting System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft over <strong>100+ items </strong>from primitive tools to advanced equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quality-based crafting: your skills improve with practice</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create weapons: spears, bows, arrows and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build structures: shelters, permanent houses, storage containers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft survival gear: clothing, armor, medical supplies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>📈 Progression &amp; Skills</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up survival skills through practice: crafting, hunting, gathering and exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock better success rates and higher quality crafted items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score system rewards clever play and overcoming challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple starting scenarios increase difficulty and replayability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4275900/extras/c678ad87744c3b71ec8d1c0f152d12d1.avif?t=1781194410\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4275900/extras_big/c678ad87744c3b71ec8d1c0f152d12d1.avif?t=1781194410 width=1560 height=510 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> 🏴‍☠️ Dynamic Encounters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet <strong>friendly NPCs </strong>who can trade, share information or become companions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face <strong>hostile survivors </strong>who seek to take your hard-earned supplies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend against <strong>wolf attacks </strong>and other predatory wildlife</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter is procedurally generated and unique</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎨 Immersive Atmosphere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich environmental storytelling through detailed descriptions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric pixel art visuals showcasing the world's beauty and danger</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic narrative intro that sets the tone for your journey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Text-based interface with modern UI design</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4275900/extras/ac468247a7ef67551797d5e159517cfe.avif?t=1781194410\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4275900/extras_big/ac468247a7ef67551797d5e159517cfe.avif?t=1781194410 width=1560 height=510 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival is Just the Beginning</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Last State</strong> you're not just trying to survive. You're building a new life in a world that's moved on without humanity. Will you become a master hunter, trading pelts and meat? A skilled craftsman, creating tools and weapons? A farmer, cultivating the land? Or an explorer, uncovering the secrets of the old world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wilderness is vast. Resources are scarce. Danger lurks in every shadow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https