om/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4275900/extras_big/ac468247a7ef67551797d5e159517cfe.avif?t=1781194410 width=1560 height=510 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival is Just the Beginning</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Last State</strong> you're not just trying to survive. You're building a new life in a world that's moved on without humanity. Will you become a master hunter, trading pelts and meat? A skilled craftsman, creating tools and weapons? A farmer, cultivating the land? Or an explorer, uncovering the secrets of the old world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wilderness is vast. Resources are scarce. Danger lurks in every shadow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4275900/extras/2cad4b7959e3343bc3eb5d21511b76e4.avif?t=1781194410\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4275900/extras_big/2cad4b7959e3343bc3eb5d21511b76e4.avif?t=1781194410 width=1560 height=510 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍​ more biomes​ (with unique points of interest)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚙️ complex game mechanics (complex and deeper actual and new game mechanics)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 more immersive desing for ​​​better gameplay experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎊 new content (storyline, collectibles...)​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎧 soundtrack (17 full themed tracks; 5 ingame now)​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remember: In the wilderness, every choice matters.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your story begins now.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Last State is a hardcore text-based wilderness survival sim where bad planning kills your run. Hunt, craft, build shelter and manage hunger, thirst, warmth, fatigue and disease in a procedural post-collapse world. Play the 60-minute Next Fest demo and extend your run with smart survival decisions", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4275900/56395aff3614c7c40d43a92e2b19b9df95371f1b/header.jpg?t=1781194410", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4275900/5c09655e2a097c8f424cab52c71bbf2e603cfed3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781194410", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4275900/5c09655e2a097c8f424cab52c71bbf2e603cfed3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781194410", "website": "https://last-state.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 2.0 GHz or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 or equivalent with OpenGL 3.3 support<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 3.0 GHz or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 